time」に変えて文脈に合うようにしました。"\n  },\n  "corrected_text": "My part-time job yesterday was hilarious! I barely made it on time and dashed into the staff room. I was like, I made it! I’m ready to work! But as it wasn’t a busy day, the teachers there were gossiping about their love lives, just passing the time. What’s more, it wasn’t a lighthearted story—one of the teachers had just broken up with her boyfriend after eleven years together. I kept thinking, ‘Is it okay for me to be here…?’ the whole time"\n}	5	5	4	2025-08-23 04:32:43.726057	2025-08-23 04:32:43.726057
